# Image-prep working directories — never committed.
# .image-staging/ holds resized, EXIF-stripped intermediates on their way to the
# CDN; .ideogram-candidates/ holds the rejected generations from an image run.
# Both are scratch: what ships is the CDN URL, or the chosen file copied into
# public/. See the prep-images-for-embed and generate-consistent-og-images
# skills.
